WEBVTT

00:07.862 --> 00:09.172
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.206 --> 00:10.862
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.896 --> 00:12.344
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.379 --> 00:14.482
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.517 --> 00:17.344
- ♪ Ohh...
- ♪ 哦...

00:17.379 --> 00:19.448
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.482 --> 00:21.448
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.482 --> 00:23.344
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:23.379 --> 00:25.206
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.241 --> 00:27.482
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.517 --> 00:29.344
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.379 --> 00:31.413
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.448 --> 00:33.448
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.482 --> 00:35.310
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.344 --> 00:37.620
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.655 --> 00:39.551
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.586 --> 00:40.896
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.931 --> 00:42.758
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.793 --> 00:45.482
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.517 --> 00:47.793
♪
♪
♪
♪

00:47.827 --> 00:49.413
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:49.862 --> 00:53.965
[laid-back steel guitar]
[悠闲的钢吉他]

00:54.000 --> 01:01.000
♪
♪
♪
♪

01:01.827 --> 01:04.172
[elegant harpsichord music]
[优雅的羽管键琴音乐]

01:04.206 --> 01:06.137
- Well, what do you think?
- 嗯，你觉得怎么样？

01:06.172 --> 01:08.482
Do you love it?
你喜欢它吗？

01:08.517 --> 01:11.965
- Mr. Tentacles, I simply
cannot express
- 触手先生，我只是
无法表达

01:12.000 --> 01:14.965
my true feelings about
your work!
我的真实感受
你的工作！

01:15.000 --> 01:19.482
- Yes, I realize my artistic
brilliance can be overwhelming.
- 是的，我意识到我的艺术
光辉可以是压倒性的。

01:19.517 --> 01:21.482
- Quite frankly...
- 坦白说...

01:21.517 --> 01:23.172
[inhales]
[吸气]

01:23.206 --> 01:25.034
It stinks!
太臭了！

01:26.413 --> 01:27.551
- Yes, and--what?!
- 是的，还有——什么？！

01:27.586 --> 01:28.586
Now, see here!
现在，看这里！

01:28.620 --> 01:31.241
Maybe this museum is too
low-brow
也许这个博物馆也是
低俗的

01:31.275 --> 01:33.172
for this masterpiece!
为了这部杰作！

01:33.206 --> 01:34.586
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

01:34.620 --> 01:37.241
How dare you! Be gone!
你怎么敢！走吧！

01:37.275 --> 01:40.000
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

01:42.000 --> 01:44.000
- And take your putrid painting
with you!
- 拿走你腐烂的画
和你在一起！

01:44.034 --> 01:47.068
It has no place in this
museum's art collection!
在此没有它的位置
博物馆的艺术收藏品！

01:49.206 --> 01:52.896
- Won't anyone save my
precious painting!?
- 没有人能救我吗
珍贵的画！？

01:53.896 --> 01:54.965
- Got it!
- 知道了！

01:55.000 --> 01:58.413
- Why couldn't it have been
anyone else?
- 为什么不可能
还有其他人吗？

01:58.448 --> 02:01.655
Give me that! [straining]
给我那个！ [紧张]

02:03.344 --> 02:05.000
What are you doing here?!
你在这里做什么？

02:05.034 --> 02:07.620
- Patrick is the museum's
new security guard!
- 帕特里克是博物馆的
新保安！

02:07.655 --> 02:10.689
And he's giving me
a guided tour.
他给我
导游陪同游览。

02:10.724 --> 02:13.172
- [grunts] Heh.
- [咕哝] 呵呵。

02:13.206 --> 02:14.517
- Him? Security?!
- 他？安全？！

02:14.551 --> 02:15.724
Pfft! Ha!
噗！哈!

02:15.758 --> 02:18.448
This museum's dumber
than I thought.
这个博物馆更蠢
比我想象的要多。

02:18.482 --> 02:20.793
Hold on, Squidward...
等等，章鱼哥……

02:20.827 --> 02:22.655
if that pointy-headed
pea brain
如果那个尖头的
豌豆脑

02:22.689 --> 02:25.275
is the security guard
for this place,
是保安
对于这个地方，

02:25.310 --> 02:29.758
then I could sneak my artwork
into the museum!
然后我就可以偷偷偷看我的作品
进博物馆！

02:29.793 --> 02:31.965
- Sneak what into a where?
- 将什么东西潜入何处？

02:32.000 --> 02:34.724
- Think louder, Squidward!
You're mumbling!
- 大声思考，章鱼哥！
你在嘀咕！

02:34.758 --> 02:36.413
- Get out of my head!
- 从我脑子里滚出去！

02:36.448 --> 02:38.551
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

02:38.586 --> 02:40.379
- [squeaking]
- [吱吱声]

02:40.413 --> 02:43.103
- [sighs] Give me that!
- [叹气]给我那个！

02:43.137 --> 02:44.344
both: Bye!
两人：再见！

02:44.379 --> 02:45.448
- Bon voyage!
- 一路顺风！

02:45.482 --> 02:47.172
- Keep making pretty pictures!
- 继续制作漂亮的图片！

02:48.862 --> 02:52.758
The first exhibit on our
tour is...
我们的第一个展览
旅游是...

02:52.793 --> 02:55.965
[eerie music]
[诡异的音乐]

02:56.000 --> 02:57.827
- Whoa!
- 哇！

02:57.862 --> 03:01.241
- The employee locker room!
- 员工更衣室！

03:01.275 --> 03:03.000
- Wow!
- 哇！

03:03.034 --> 03:06.172
Your life is so
glamorous!
你的生活就是这样
迷人！

03:06.206 --> 03:09.620
- You could be my
junior assistant!
- 你可以是我的
初级助理！

03:09.655 --> 03:11.758
- Really?!
- Sure.
- 真的吗？！
- 当然。

03:11.793 --> 03:15.655
There's a ton of uniforms
in these metal boxes!
有很多制服
在这些金属盒子里！

03:15.689 --> 03:16.758
Check it out!
一探究竟！

03:16.793 --> 03:19.620
Let me just get my key.
让我去拿我的钥匙。

03:19.655 --> 03:21.517
[straining]
[紧张]

03:21.551 --> 03:23.206
Put this on!
- Okay!
穿上这个！
- 好的！

03:23.241 --> 03:24.482
[yells]
[喊叫]

03:27.724 --> 03:29.689
Well, how do I look?
嗯，我看起来怎么样？

03:29.724 --> 03:31.965
- Guard-tastic!
- 防守太棒了！

03:32.620 --> 03:35.758
[indistinct chatter]
[模糊的喋喋不休]

03:35.793 --> 03:39.034
Now, rule number one
of guarding is,
现在，第一条规则
的守护是，

03:39.068 --> 03:41.620
don't let visitors touch stuff.
不要让访客触摸东西。

03:41.655 --> 03:44.586
- No touchy, no feely.
Eye-eye.
- 没有敏感，没有感觉。
眼对眼。

03:44.620 --> 03:47.586
- Rule number B: no running!
- 规则 B：禁止跑步！

03:47.620 --> 03:49.862
[children shouting]
[孩子们喊叫]

03:51.068 --> 03:54.758
- Single file, children,
single file.
- 单列，儿童，
单个文件。

03:55.793 --> 04:00.965
- But stampeding is just fine.
- 但是踩踏就可以了。

04:02.206 --> 04:05.448
And the most important rule
of all is,
还有最重要的规则
最重要的是，

04:05.482 --> 04:08.172
don't let visitors steal stuff!
不要让游客偷东西！

04:08.206 --> 04:10.586
If you see anybody suspicious,
如果你看到有人可疑

04:10.620 --> 04:13.448
you give them the ol'
stink eye!
你给他们 ol'
臭眼睛！

04:13.482 --> 04:14.896
Hmm.
唔。

04:14.931 --> 04:17.724
- [chuckling]
- [轻笑]

04:17.758 --> 04:18.793
Hm?
嗯？

04:18.827 --> 04:20.448
[eyes hissing]
[眼睛发出嘶嘶声]

04:21.379 --> 04:24.931
[groaning]
[呻吟]

04:25.448 --> 04:26.758
- Now you try!
- 现在你试试吧！

04:26.793 --> 04:28.689
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

04:28.724 --> 04:29.689
- Whew.
- 呼。

04:29.724 --> 04:30.931
[screams]
[尖叫声]

04:30.965 --> 04:32.620
- [straining]
- [紧张]

04:32.655 --> 04:34.448
[squeaking]
[吱吱声]

04:35.517 --> 04:37.034
- Mmmm.
- 嗯。

04:37.068 --> 04:40.413
Ooh, delicious. [giggling]
哦，好吃。 [咯咯笑]

04:40.448 --> 04:41.793
- Ohh...
- 哦...

04:41.827 --> 04:44.034
- You'll get there, pal.
- 你会到达那里的，朋友。

04:46.655 --> 04:49.241
Behold, SpongeBob.
看哪，海绵宝宝。

04:49.275 --> 04:55.000
Before laughter, there was
the pre-hysterical period.
在笑声之前，有
歇斯底里前期。

04:57.068 --> 04:59.310
- [gasps] Oh, look, honey!
- [喘气]哦，看，亲爱的！

04:59.344 --> 05:01.586
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

05:01.620 --> 05:03.862
- What an excellent example
- 多么好的例子啊

05:03.896 --> 05:05.931
of the primitive security
guard era.
原始安全的
后卫时代。

05:05.965 --> 05:09.482
- Ooh! I almost forgot
rule number fourth!
- 哦！我差点忘了
第四条规则！

05:09.517 --> 05:11.448
No flash photography!
禁止闪光摄影！

05:11.482 --> 05:12.862
[both scream]
[两人尖叫]

05:12.896 --> 05:18.379
And that is everything I know
about being a security guard.
这就是我所知道的一切
关于当一名保安。

05:21.793 --> 05:24.379
[chomping]
[咀嚼]

05:26.068 --> 05:27.551
[belches]
- Oh!
[打嗝]
- 哦！

05:31.068 --> 05:33.862
- Now, I'll teach you
everything I don't know.
- 现在我来教你
一切我都不知道。

05:33.896 --> 05:36.620
[crickets chirping]
[蟋蟀鸣叫]

05:36.655 --> 05:38.862
Right this way.
就这样。

05:38.896 --> 05:40.689
- Oh, boy!
- 哦，孩子！

05:40.724 --> 05:42.793
An extinct wooly mollusk!
一种已灭绝的毛状软体动物！

05:42.827 --> 05:44.137
[trumpeting]
[喇叭声]

05:44.172 --> 05:46.310
Aw, this little guy looks like
my Gary.
噢，这个小家伙看起来像
我的加里。

05:46.344 --> 05:47.413
Meow.
喵。

05:47.448 --> 05:49.896
Too bad we aren't
allowed to touch anything.
可惜我们不是
允许触摸任何东西。

05:49.931 --> 05:51.655
- Pfft! SpongeBob,
- 噗！海绵宝宝，

05:51.689 --> 05:53.862
the rules don't
apply to us.
规则没有
向我们申请。

05:53.896 --> 05:56.620
We're security!
- Hooray!
我们是保安！
- 万岁！

05:58.965 --> 06:02.172
[giggling]
[咯咯笑]

06:03.758 --> 06:05.517
Pffft!
噗！

06:05.551 --> 06:07.655
[giggling]
[咯咯笑]

06:10.551 --> 06:12.655
[buzzing]
[嗡嗡声]

06:13.896 --> 06:16.344
- Is that it?
Come on.
- 是这样吗？
快点。

06:16.379 --> 06:18.310
Do something!
做点什么吧！

06:18.344 --> 06:20.620
[growling]
[咆哮]

06:20.655 --> 06:22.655
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

06:22.689 --> 06:25.586
Why! Won't! You! Work?!
为什么！惯于！你！工作？！

06:25.620 --> 06:26.655
Huh?
啊？

06:30.517 --> 06:32.379
[both scream]
[两人尖叫]

06:32.413 --> 06:34.448
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

06:35.310 --> 06:40.413
And here we see the ancient
junk of the great empire
在这里我们看到了古老的
伟大帝国的垃圾

06:40.448 --> 06:43.413
of Pat-Lantis!
帕特·兰蒂斯！

06:43.448 --> 06:46.482
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

06:47.000 --> 06:48.862
- [whistles]
- [口哨]

06:48.896 --> 06:49.896
- Hm?
- 嗯？

06:49.931 --> 06:53.068
Hey! No touching
the exhibits, buddy!
嘿！禁止触摸
展品，伙计！

06:53.103 --> 06:55.310
[grunting] Oof!
[咕噜声]噢！

06:55.344 --> 06:56.931
[rumbling]
[隆隆声]

06:56.965 --> 06:58.551
[all scream]
[所有人尖叫]

06:58.586 --> 07:00.931
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

07:00.965 --> 07:03.172
[toilet flushes]
[厕所冲水]

07:03.206 --> 07:04.448
- Hmm...
- 唔...

07:04.482 --> 07:06.310
[gasps]
[喘气]

07:10.965 --> 07:13.379
- Sorry about that, mister.
- 抱歉，先生。

07:13.413 --> 07:15.482
Ooh!
哦！

07:15.517 --> 07:19.551
- Huh? Oh, look, Patrick!
A mummy!
- 啊？哦，看，帕特里克！
一个木乃伊！

07:19.586 --> 07:22.517
- Mummy! Awww.
- 妈妈！噢。

07:22.551 --> 07:25.137
- Uh, no, Patrick.
It's not your mother--
- 呃，不，帕特里克。
这不是你妈妈——

07:25.172 --> 07:28.000
- Love your new look!
How's dad?
- 喜欢你的新造型！
爸爸怎么样？

07:28.034 --> 07:29.965
- Never mind.
- 没关系。

07:30.000 --> 07:32.103
[stampeding]
[踩踏]

07:34.482 --> 07:36.620
Will those kids be okay
in there?
那些孩子们会好吗
在那里？

07:36.655 --> 07:39.620
- Oh sure, Mummy loves kids!
- 哦，当然，妈妈喜欢孩子！

07:39.655 --> 07:41.758
I think this is yours.
我想这是你的。

07:41.793 --> 07:43.862
- Hm. Huh?
- 嗯。啊？

07:43.896 --> 07:46.034
[stampeding]
[踩踏]

07:46.068 --> 07:48.310
Single file, children.
孩子们，单列。

07:48.344 --> 07:49.758
[groans]
[呻吟]

07:52.344 --> 07:53.689
- Ooooh.
- 噢。

07:53.724 --> 07:55.586
Ooooh!
哦哦！

07:55.620 --> 07:57.344
Ooh-ooh-ooh.
哦哦哦。

07:57.379 --> 07:59.137
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

08:00.103 --> 08:04.344
- Hee!
both: Whatcha doin'?!
- 嘿！
两人：在做什么？！

08:04.379 --> 08:05.758
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

08:05.793 --> 08:09.551
I'm cleaning centuries of dirt
from this priceless painting.
我正在清理几个世纪的污垢
来自这幅无价的画作。

08:09.586 --> 08:11.517
- Going too slow!
- 速度太慢了！

08:11.551 --> 08:14.413
- I think I know how we can
speed things along!
- 我想我知道我们该怎么做
加快进度！

08:14.448 --> 08:17.034
- Please stand back
for your safety.
- 请往后站
为了您的安全。

08:17.068 --> 08:18.793
Ooh!
哦！

08:18.827 --> 08:20.862
[grinding]
[研磨]

08:22.000 --> 08:24.000
[bells jangling]
[铃声叮当作响]

08:24.034 --> 08:25.379
Here you go!
干得好！

08:27.896 --> 08:30.000
[shattering]
[破碎]

08:30.034 --> 08:33.000
[sunny music]
[阳光音乐]

08:33.034 --> 08:36.379
♪
♪
♪
♪

08:36.413 --> 08:38.103
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

08:38.137 --> 08:40.931
[maniacal laughter]
[疯狂的笑声]

08:40.965 --> 08:43.862
- Now to hang my masterpiece.
- 现在要挂我的杰作了。

08:43.896 --> 08:45.896
Mm-hmm...
嗯嗯...

08:45.931 --> 08:47.896
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

08:47.931 --> 08:50.137
[chuckling]
[轻笑]

08:50.931 --> 08:52.689
[muttering]
[嘀咕]

08:52.724 --> 08:56.689
- Ooh! I didn't know they had
pin the tail on the sea-donkey!
- 哦！我不知道他们有
把尾巴钉在海驴身上！

08:56.724 --> 08:59.241
- This place has everything!
- 这个地方什么都有！

08:59.275 --> 09:01.310
[both giggling]
[两人都咯咯笑]

09:02.896 --> 09:04.689
[camera shutter clicks]
[相机快门声]

09:04.724 --> 09:06.517
- Hey! No flash photography!
- 嘿！禁止闪光摄影！

09:06.551 --> 09:07.896
- Whew!
- 哇！

09:07.931 --> 09:09.413
[chuckling]
[轻笑]

09:09.448 --> 09:10.724
[gasps]
[喘气]

09:10.758 --> 09:12.965
- Yahhh!
- 啊哈！

09:13.000 --> 09:17.137
- [neighing]
- [嘶嘶声]

09:17.172 --> 09:19.620
- The winner!
- 获胜者！

09:19.655 --> 09:21.344
- [chuckling]
- [轻笑]

09:21.379 --> 09:23.241
- Did you see that guy?
- Yeah!
- 你看到那个人了吗？
- 是的！

09:23.275 --> 09:26.103
No running allowed!
Let's get him!
不允许跑步！
我们来抓住他吧！

09:28.827 --> 09:31.344
- Hee-haw!
- 嘻哈！

09:32.241 --> 09:34.103
Ah! They're finally gone!
啊!他们终于走了！

09:34.137 --> 09:36.827
[chortling]
[咯咯笑]

09:36.862 --> 09:38.448
Hmm? Hmm.
唔？唔。

09:38.482 --> 09:39.793
[grunts]
[咕哝]

09:45.482 --> 09:47.724
- Hey, Patrick?
I think that guy's trying to--
- 嘿，帕特里克？
我认为那家伙正试图——

09:47.758 --> 09:49.482
- Touch that painting!
- 触摸那幅画！

09:49.517 --> 09:50.896
- Hmm? Hmm.
- 唔？唔。

09:50.931 --> 09:52.068
[chuckling]
[轻笑]

09:52.103 --> 09:56.000
- Uh-oh!
- And now he's stealing it!
- 呃哦！
- 现在他正在偷东西！

09:56.034 --> 09:58.551
- [imitates siren]
- [模仿塞壬]

09:58.586 --> 10:00.793
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

10:00.827 --> 10:02.758
Oh, no. Dead end!
哦，不。死胡同！

10:04.206 --> 10:08.103
[sitar music]
[西塔琴音乐]

10:08.137 --> 10:10.275
[gasps]
[喘气]

10:10.310 --> 10:12.000
- Stop, thief!
- 住手，小偷！

10:12.034 --> 10:13.482
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

10:13.517 --> 10:14.862
Ha, ha--oh!
哈、哈——哦！

10:14.896 --> 10:16.827
[grunts]
[咕哝]

10:19.379 --> 10:21.793
- Looks like this case
is all wrapped up.
- 看起来像这个案例
都被包裹起来了。

10:21.827 --> 10:23.172
- [mumbling]
- [咕哝]

10:23.206 --> 10:27.862
- Thank you, Mummy.
- Anytime, sweetie.
- 谢谢你，妈妈。
- 任何时候，亲爱的。

10:27.896 --> 10:29.724
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

10:29.758 --> 10:33.413
[all panting]
[全都气喘吁吁]

10:33.448 --> 10:36.793
- [wheezing]
We're never gonna catch him!
- [喘息]
我们永远抓不到他！

10:37.551 --> 10:39.793
- Ooh! The woolly mollusk!
- 哦！毛茸茸的软体动物！

10:40.724 --> 10:42.310
Ah!
啊!

10:43.620 --> 10:44.586
- Hi-ya!
- 嗨呀！

10:44.620 --> 10:46.482
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

10:46.517 --> 10:48.551
- [roars]
- [咆哮]

10:51.965 --> 10:54.137
- Hmm.
- Um...
- 唔。
- 嗯...

10:55.172 --> 10:58.000
[grunting] Come on.
[咕哝]来吧。

10:58.034 --> 10:59.206
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

10:59.241 --> 11:02.620
- [panting]
Ha, ha! Too slow!
- [气喘吁吁]
哈，哈！太慢了！

11:02.655 --> 11:04.724
[stampeding]
[踩踏]

11:04.758 --> 11:06.517
- Single file, children.
- 单列，孩子们。

11:06.551 --> 11:08.724
Single file.
单个文件。

11:08.758 --> 11:10.689
- [chuckling]
- [轻笑]

11:10.724 --> 11:13.206
[both shout]
[两人大喊]

11:13.241 --> 11:16.379
- We've secured
the purple-tater, over.
- 我们已经确保了
紫色土豆，结束了。

11:17.344 --> 11:19.206
[siren wailing]
[警笛哀号]

11:19.241 --> 11:21.965
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

11:22.000 --> 11:24.103
Hmm?
唔？

11:24.137 --> 11:26.034
- There! Back where you belong.
- 那里！回到属于你的地方。

11:26.068 --> 11:29.137
- [mumbling] It's beautiful!
- [咕哝] 太漂亮了！

11:29.172 --> 11:31.551
- You actually like
that eyesore?
- 你其实喜欢
那个碍眼的？

11:31.586 --> 11:35.758
- Why, it's the greatest
painting I've ever seen...
- 为什么，这是最伟大的
我见过的画...

11:35.793 --> 11:38.724
hanging in a museum!
挂在博物馆里！

11:38.758 --> 11:40.827
[cackling]
[咯咯笑]

11:40.862 --> 11:43.724
- Okay, that's enough, weirdo.
- 好吧，够了，怪人。

11:44.310 --> 11:48.206
- [chuckling]
- [轻笑]

- [轻笑]